{"4191840": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Eccentricity", "steam_appid": 4191840, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4191840/extras/4b6736f7b8e9b84e01872ab9c96ed7af.avif?t=1788116491\" width=620 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Eccentricity</strong> is a steampunk engineering roguelike about building the ultimate chain-reaction machine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ARRANGE MACHINES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each machine has a purpose. <strong>Generators</strong> produce Energy and Heat, <strong>Coolers</strong> consume Energy to reduce Heat, <strong>Mines</strong> generate resources such as Brass. Position them strategically on your grid to maximize production.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >TRIGGER CHAIN REACTIONS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Machines activate one by one. Arrange them in the correct order to trigger surprising synergies that multiply your output. Optimize, overclock, and break the game.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MANAGE HEAT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With great Energy comes great Heat. Cool your machines before they break from overheating.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DRAFT BLUEPRINTS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >50+ unique machines to draft. Experiment with different builds to unlock creative and powerful synergies.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MEET RISING QUOTAS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive through escalating daily quotas. Push your machines to their absolute limits.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EVERY RUN IS UNIQUE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every choice matters. Explore endless combinations of machines and hidden interactions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: cent